 </span><span begin="01:14.580" end="01:14.790">want </span><span begin="01:14.790" end="01:15.030">to </span><span begin="01:15.030" end="01:15.240">have </span><span begin="01:15.240" end="01:15.630">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.660" end="01:19.410"><span begin="01:15.660" end="01:15.990">No </span><span begin="01:15.990" end="01:16.170">we're </span><span begin="01:16.170" end="01:16.440">not </span><span begin="01:16.440" end="01:16.890">looking </span><span begin="01:16.890" end="01:17.100">for </span><span begin="01:17.100" end="01:17.970">violence</span><span begin="01:17.970" end="01:18.000">, </span><span begin="01:18.000" end="01:18.180">no </span><span begin="01:18.180" end="01:18.390">oh </span><span begin="01:18.390" end="01:18.480">oh </span><span begin="01:18.480" end="01:19.410">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.440" end="01:22.860"><span begin="01:19.440" end="01:20.010">Tonight </span><span begin="01:20.010" end="01:20.190">we </span><span begin="01:20.190" end="01:20.430">want </span><span begin="01:20.430" end="01:20.640">to </span><span begin="01:20.640" end="01:20.880">have </span><span begin="01:20.880" end="01:22.860">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.740" end="01:31.650"><span begin="01:28.740" end="01:29.130">No </span><span begin="01:29.130" end="01:29.400">one's </span><span begin="01:29.400" end="01:29.490">the </span><span begin="01:29.490" end="01:29.880">same </span><span begin="01:29.880" end="01:30.060">as </span><span begin="01:30.060" end="01:30.270">they </span><span begin="01:30.270" end="01:30.570">used </span><span begin="01:30.570" end="01:30.690">to </span><span begin="01:30.690" end="01:31.650">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.460" end="01:35.100"><span begin="01:32.460" end="01:32.910">Much </span><span begin="01:32.910" end="01:33.120">as </span><span begin="01:33.120" end="01:33.270">we </span><span begin="01:33.270" end="01:33.540">try </span><span begin="01:33.540" end="0